Ramulator 2.1
-------------

The `ramulator2/` directory is a Git submodule of the maintained
https://github.com/TtitiO/ramulator2 fork. It contains Ramulator 2.1 from
CMU-SAFARI plus the PIMScope LPDDR5-PIM implementation. Ramulator is distributed
under its own MIT license; see `ramulator2/LICENSE` and its repository history
for copyright and attribution details.

Build dependencies
------------------

Ramulator's CMake build fetches or uses the following third-party projects,
each under its own license:

- yaml-cpp: https://github.com/jbeder/yaml-cpp
- fmt: https://github.com/fmtlib/fmt
- nanobind: https://github.com/wjakob/nanobind
- argparse: https://github.com/p-ranav/argparse

This NOTICE is informational and does not replace the corresponding upstream
license files. Generated experiment results and figures should retain their
provenance metadata and cite both PIMScope and Ramulator as appropriate.
